window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>“A human torn between two wolf-shifters. A world where survival means choosing sides—and trusting your heart.\"</p> <p>\"When passion ignites in the wild, love becomes the ultimate instinct for survival.\"</p> <p>\"Two alpha wolves. One human woman. A love triangle in a world where trust is a dangerous game.\"</p> <p>\"In a post-apocalyptic world of predators and prey, can love bridge the divide between human and shifter?\"</p> <p>\"Survival demands courage. Love demands everything. Who will Jayden choose in the fight for her heart—and her life?”</p>"; 
